        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-29T05:00:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think no. &nbsp;Like the card game, you tend to revolve things in the order written. &nbsp;Attack (resolve attack) then hinder. &nbsp;There are a few abilities that&nbsp;break this rule, but they are explicitly called out.</p>",
